	"Description": "I recolored the original Ostrich Sprites for myself. I never recolored pixel art, and they might be not perfect, nor something special. I thought I share them, thou.\n\n**Credit:**\n- Eric Barone - ConcernedApe\n- Pathoschild for Content Patcher\uFEFF and SMAPI \uFEFF\n- PeacefulEnd for Alternative Textures\n\n\n\uFEFF**Works with SV 1.6.**\n\n**CP version:**\nRequirement: \n- Content Patcher \n\nThe default color for the adult and baby ostrich is pink.\nAfter starting game one time, edit the config file.\n\nVariants are:\n- white\n- blue\n- green\n- pink\n- false\n\nOr use Generic Mod Config Menu.\n\n**AT version:**\nRequirement: \n- Alternative Textures \n\n\nHighly recommend using a reshade - I am using Illuzio 's Natural Color - Reshade.\n\nHave Fun!\nCheers\nLeeloo\n\n\nPermission:\nYou are NOT allowed to upload this mod as is, anywhere else.\nFree to use as part of your own project, but I want to be credited proper, and I want to be informed over PM.\n\n**Adopt 'n' Skin Version is outdated, please use Alternative Textures instead.** \n",
